Package: shiny.cov
Type: Package
Title: UI and Server Coverage for Shiny Apps Tested via UI-Driven Test Frameworks
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("David", "Díaz", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "daviddrsch@gmail.com")
    )
Description: Provides line coverage and UI interaction coverage for Shiny
    applications tested with UI-driven frameworks such as shinytest2,
    Cypress, or Playwright (the latter two via companion npm packages,
    'shiny.cov-cypress' and 'shiny.cov-playwright'). Instruments R code
    executed inside child Shiny processes,
    including {box}/rhino modules, using an in-tree AST tracer ported from
    {covr} rather than calling covr's internal, unexported functions at
    runtime. Produces standard covr coverage objects compatible with
    covr::report(), covr::codecov(), and CI coverage services.
    Builds a UI manifest that catalogs all Shiny inputs, outputs, tabs, and
    modules, and merges UI interaction coverage directly into the same
    coverage object as R line coverage.
